{"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"list":[{"id":"p_seed_010","createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:13:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:43.015Z","author":{"uid":"u_data","name":"数据小站","handle":"data_station","verified":false,"bio":"用图表说话，拒绝感觉派","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"机电产品出口增长 12%，跨境电商拉动明显。传统外贸企业这几年最大的功课，是从「接单」变成「自己找客户」。#外贸#","images":[],"quote":{"id":"n_0138pz1","title":"外贸数据超预期：机电产品出口增长 12%，跨境电商拉动明显","summary":"最新外贸数据显示，机电产品出口同比增长 12%，跨境电商进出口规模继续扩大，成为拉动外贸增长的重要力量。","cover":"./img/news/33-finance-cover.jpg","channel":"finance","channelName":"财经","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["外贸"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":657,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"views":27435,"bookmarks":22},"score":7,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T23:13:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_007","createdAt":"2026-09-13T11:01:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:43.020Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"一个有点扎心的观察：小区里的智能快递柜越来越多，会跟你打招呼的快递员越来越少了。技术在进步，人情味别掉队。#城市观察#","images":[],"quote":null,"topics":["城市观察"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":600,"reposts":0,"replies":2,"views":19352,"bookmarks":55},"score":6.9,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T11:01:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_025","createdAt":"2026-09-13T20:37:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:42.999Z","author":{"uid":"u_book","name":"读库笔记","handle":"reading_notes","verified":false,"bio":"读书、看展、逛博物馆","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"非遗工坊开进商圈，油纸伞、扎染、木刻都能自己上手做。手作体验成为周末新选择，挺好——传统手艺需要的从来不是被保护，而是被使用。","images":["./img/news/a-n_mu1zjf3cf084me-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_035jskd","title":"非遗工坊走进城市商圈：手作体验成周末新选择","summary":"越来越多非遗工坊开进城市商圈，扎染、木作、金工等手作体验课程成为周末热门选项，部分课程需提前两周预约。","cover":"./img/news/11-culture-cover.jpg","channel":"culture","channelName":"文化","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"lik