_side","verified":true,"bio":"赛事解读与运动员故事","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"五万人同时在看台上唱队歌是什么体验？收官战现场那种声浪，隔着屏幕都能起鸡皮疙瘩。青训体系能不能跟上，决定了这份热闹能持续多久。","images":["./img/news/31-finance-cover.jpg","./img/news/24-sports-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_023j2s5","title":"职业联赛收官战吸引超过五万观众，青训体系建设成焦点","summary":"职业联赛收官战现场观众超过五万人，创下本赛季新高。赛后，多支球队公布了未来三年的梯队建设计划，青训投入占比将逐步提高。","cover":"./img/news/23-sports-cover.jpg","channel":"sports","channelName":"体育","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":[],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":351,"reposts":1,"replies":1,"views":21452,"bookmarks":12},"score":6.1,"repostedBy":{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash"},"reposters":[{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇快讯","handle":"huanyu_flash"}],"repostCount":1,"feedAt":"2026-09-14T04:25:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_028","createdAt":"2026-09-13T17:43:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:42.996Z","author":{"uid":"u_may","name":"街拍阿May","handle":"may_street","verified":false,"bio":"用照片记录城市的光","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"第一次进数据中心参观，最冲击的不是机器多，而是安静——安静得能听见自己的脚步。那种「庞大的东西安静地运转」的感觉很难描述。#纪录片#","images":["./img/news/04-video-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_045lv5o","title":"纪录片片段：数据中心的一天，算力是如何被调度的","summary":"当你在手机上点击一次 AI 对话，背后是什么在运转？本期视频走进数据中心，记录算力调度的日常。","cover":"./img/news/01-video-cover.jpg","channel":"video","channelName":"视频","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["纪录片"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":689,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":17562,"bookmarks":25},"score":5.6,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T17:43:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_031","createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:49:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:42.994Z","author":{"uid":"u_life","name":"城市生活志","handle":"city_life","verified":true,"bio":"记录城市里的烟火气与人情味","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"24 小时书店、深夜食堂带动的客流增长了三成。夜晚的城市不该只有便利店和外卖，还有热汤和聊天声。#城市观察#","images":["./img/news/a-n_mu1zjfgcnov8vu-cover.jpg","./img/news/40-china-fig1.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_002noey","title":"城市夜间经济回暖：24 小时书店、深夜食堂带动客流增长三成","summary":"入秋以来，多个城市的夜间消费明显升温。第三方平台数据显示，晚间 8 点至次日 1 点的餐饮、娱乐、零售订单量同比增长 31%，24 小时营业的门店数量同比增加近两成。","cover":"./img/news/44-china-cover.jpg","channel":"china","channelName":"国内","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["城市观察"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":422,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":16099,"bookmarks":31},"score":5.5,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T23:49:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_037","createdAt":"2026-09-13T11:13:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:42.990Z","author":{"uid":"u_book","name":"读库笔记","handle":"reading_notes","verified":false,"bio":"读书、看展、逛博物馆","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"海外中餐「本地化」的讨论很有意思：小份菜、植物基菜品走俏，是妥协还是进化？食物的传播史本来就是一部不断改写配方的历史。#美食#","images":["./img/news/39-world-fig1.jpg","./img/news/a-n_mu1zjeuce9zyji-cover.jpg"],"quote":{"id":"n_011trgz","title":"海外中餐加速\"本地化\"：小份菜与植物基菜品走俏","summary":"多家海外中餐连锁品牌披露最新经营数据，门店数量一年内增长约四成，其中主打小份菜与植物基菜品的门店表现最为亮眼。","cover":"./img/news/35-world-cover.jpg","channel":"world","channelName":"国际","source":"寰宇新闻网"},"topics":["美食"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":655,"reposts":0,"replies":1,"views":16847,"bookmarks":28},"score":5.3,"repostedBy":null,"reposters":[],"repostCount":0,"feedAt":"2026-09-13T11:13:36.677Z"},{"id":"p_seed_046","createdAt":"2026-09-11T18:01:36.677Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T14:30:42.980Z","author":{"uid":"u_tech","name":"科技观察室","handle":"tech_lab","verified":true,"bio":"人工智能、芯片与前沿科技观察","color":"#0b4f9e"},"content":"一个反常识的结论：大多数 AI 项目失败不是因为模型不行，而是因为没人用。上线第一天就要想清楚「谁会打开它」。#人工智能#","images":["./img/news/27-tech-cover.jpg"],"quote":null,"topics":["人工智能"],"repostOf":"","pinned":false,"status":"published","stats":{"likes":534,"reposts":3,"replies":2,"views":16020,"bookmarks":57},"score":5.2,"repostedBy":{"uid":"u_book","name":"读库笔记","handle":"reading_notes"},"reposters":[{"uid":"u_book","name":"读库笔记","handle":"reading_notes"},{"uid":"u_data","name":"数据小站","handle":"data_station"},{"uid":"u_flash","name":"寰宇